{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Speak now in the ears of Pharaoh.</b> Because he was the one who brought in and brought out, as it is written: 'without you no man shall lift his hand' etc. He thought it would seem difficult in Pharaoh's eyes how he himself would leave the land. Also Pharaoh was afraid lest Joseph remain in the land of Canaan, with all the strength and heart of the people of the land of Egypt in his hand."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:22.310712160Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}